    "ContentType": "html",
    "Content": "<p>Azure Event Grid now supports 220+&nbsp;<a href=\"https://nam06.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fapi.sap.com%2Fproducts%2FSAPS4HANA%2Fevents%2Fevents&amp;data=05%7C01%7Cv-khahmed%40microsoft.com%7C9bc00ae41fdf4f70311208dab614713e%7C72f988bf86f141af91ab2d7cd011db47%7C1%7C0%7C638022496157336806%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%3D%7C3000%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=%2BN084z50h6xSa%2B0IQZJajdvK478XA66WXAPpDGbKj1g%3D&amp;reserved=0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">SAP S/4HANA events</a>. With the availability of these events, you can now integrate your applications on Azure with SAP&rsquo;s using event-driven architectures. &nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://nam06.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=http%3A%2F%2Faka.ms%2Fsap-events&amp;data=05%7C01%7Cv-khahmed%40microsoft.com%7C9bc00ae41fdf4f70311208dab614713e%7C72f988bf86f141af91ab2d7cd011db47%7C1%7C0%7C638022496157336806%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%3D%7C3000%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=p72S3qTHylhSm1FO6mqmRCylpkgyfE6A%2FnS4DWHl5go%3D&amp;reserved=0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Learn more</a>.</p>\r\n",
    "Markdown": "Azure Event Grid now supports 220+ SAP S/4HANA events . With the availability of these events, you can now integrate your applications on Azure with SAP’s using event-driven architectures.\n\nLearn more ."
  },
